bb_paragraph\" >Your progress through the depends on how you manage your resources. Kill the enemies you encounter and collect their drop.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rogue Like Mode</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase or upgrade cards and weapons or continue to survive by purchasing supplies from stores that will randomly appear as you progress through the Levels.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Campaign Mode</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In between waves, buy supplies from the Shop or continue the fight with a new weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968260/extras/c070b8ffd980e645850a0fd3e5b0bbfc.avif?t=1741258650\" data-has-big width=800 height=168 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies will become stronger on each level, which will require constant upgrades and development of your weapons. As you pass the levels, you will be able to upgrade your weapons as you wish with the special coins you collect and have the opportunity to use them at their full power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968260/extras/dc776b0e8eb3f9db4ca0bd5b91dc02a2.avif?t=1741258650\" data-has-big width=800 height=202 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase your chances of survival by drinking and eating consumables found almost everywhere you can see on the map, in the environment, in the city, in the houses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968260/extras/558aa342446dbdaa067144b6227c0f80.avif?t=1741258650\" data-has-big width=800 height=183 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig the graves on the map and collect the rewards inside. Explode the surrounding barrels and make it easier to kill your enemies. Discover different ways to kill your enemies by using many more objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968260/extras/2a0cc81b6c7fee89234b25c8fdd65153.avif?t=1741258650\" data-has-big width=800 height=182 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can join our Discord server to support our game, stay up to date on its development, and give us feedback!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
